  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Almost Heaven is a charming residential property nestled in the beautiful community of Watersound, FL. This exceptional home presents a remarkable opportunity to stay where coastal charm and luxurious living harmoniously converge in an exquisite slice of paradise. Located in the sought-after Watersound neighborhood, residents enjoy a serene and laid-back atmosphere with stunning natural surroundings.<br><br>Included is use/access to the separate carriage house on the property with bedding for 4. Sleeping capacity of 12 includes carriage house occupancy. <br><br>The main residence features a thoughtfully designed layout with modern amenities and high-end finishes. The interior boasts spacious living areas, including a gourmet kitchen with top-of-the-line appliances and a stylish dining area perfect for entertaining guests. The living room provides a comfortable space to relax, with large windows that fill the room with natural light and offer picturesque views of the surrounding landscape. The master suite is a private retreat, offering a luxurious escape with its spa-like bathroom and ample closet space. Three additional bedrooms and a bunk room provide versatility for accommodating family or guests, each designed with comfort and relaxation in mind.<br><br>As you step into the Carriage House, you'll be greeted by a bright and airy living area that features comfortable seating, a flat-screen TV, and a convenient sleeper sofa that can accommodate two additional guests. The space seamlessly flows into a fully-equipped kitchen, complete with stainless steel appliances and all the necessary utensils and cookware to whip up delicious meals. The bedroom of this Carriage House is furnished with a comfortable queen-size bed, ensuring a good night's sleep after a fun-filled day exploring the area. The bathroom is modern and features a shower/tub combo.<br><br>Watersound itself is a captivating coastal community known for its pristine beaches and untouched natural beauty. Residents have access to exclusive amenities, including private beach access, swimming pools, and walking trails. The community's commitment to preserving the environment allows residents to enjoy a tranquil and idyllic setting.<br><br>In addition to the breathtaking scenery, Watersound offers convenient proximity to local shops, restaurants, and recreational activities. The area is renowned for its outdoor adventures, such as fishing, boating, and golfing, ensuring there is always something to explore and enjoy.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (SLEEPS 12)<br>Main House<br>• Master Bedroom, 1st Floor: 1 King<br>• Guest Bedroom 1, 1st Floor: 1 Queen <br>• Guest Bedroom 2, 2nd Floor: 1 Queen <br>• Guest Bedroom 3, 2nd Floor: 1 Queen <br>• Loft, 3rd Floor: 1 Twin over Twin Bunk<br>Carriage House<br>• Master Bedroom: 1 Queen<br>• Living Room: 1 Queen Sleeper Sofa<br><br>*Please note that the garage is not available for guest use.<br><br>Blue Swell Vacation Rentals is a boutique property management company that specializes in top-of-the-line, luxury beach rentals from PCB, 30A, and Destin. Our loyal guests come back year after year because of the exclusive homes and condos we offer as well as the excellent service we provide. Our keyless entry, premier linens with 300 thread count sheets, plush towels, and high-end starter supplies are just the beginning of the convenient amenities we provide for every guest. Most importantly, Blue Swell’s phone service allows our guests to experience the best vacation ever with less stress. It is always a SWELL day at the beach!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
